From 980961857097494d8ba49425ed0f99499bd2ab7c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ga=C3=ABl=20Duval?= <gael@murena.io>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 14:44:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] perf(fonts): do not pick a fallback font for Private Use
 Area characters [upstreamable]

At open, every character of the document goes through the font picker,
which adds the font that AllFonts.js assigns to its Unicode range to the
fonts to download. Word stores symbol-font characters in the Private Use
Area (the standard bullet is U+F0B7 in Symbol), and with the bundled
fonts that range resolves to NanumBarunGothic, so every document with
ordinary bullets downloaded and loaded a Korean font in two styles
(8.6 MB, 4.1 MB compressed). PUA code points only mean something in the
font that defines them and symbol fonts are drawn through their own
mapping, so a fallback font is never right for them: return no font.

Rendering unchanged: first pages of perf-10p.docx (tools/perf) and of
the public corpus documents a09 and a10 (Symbol bullets) are
pixel-identical before and after; NanumBarunGothic is no longer loaded.

Opening a 10-page document with bullets (tools/perf, own instance,
CPU x1, 5 runs, medians): transferred 14.3 -> 10.2 MB, requests 74 -> 72;
editable cold cache 1405 -> 1281 ms, warm cache 1038 -> 985 ms.

Assisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 common/libfont/character.js | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/common/libfont/character.js b/common/libfont/character.js
index 45628d4435..4123dbe364 100644
--- a/common/libfont/character.js
+++ b/common/libfont/character.js
@@ -125,6 +125,14 @@
 			if (undefined === _char || 0 == _char)
 				return "";
 
+			// Private Use Area code points mean something only in the font that defines them
+			// (Word stores symbol-font characters there, e.g. U+F0B7, the Symbol bullet, which
+			// is drawn with the symbol font): another font is never the right fallback, so do
+			// not pick one - picking it made every document with standard bullets download a
+			// Korean font (NanumBarunGothic, 2 x 4 MB) at open.
+			if ((_char >= 0xE000 && _char <= 0xF8FF) || _char >= 0xF0000)
+				return "";
+
 			if (this.LastRange)
 			{
 				if (this.LastRange.Start <= _char && _char <= this.LastRange.End)
-- 
